                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bc154adc-0bfd-3fbb-9a8a-f29d4b0a5684",
                        "entry_id": "ee988cf0-3c8b-371d-9a5c-4a4869768335",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Familiar, famous, renowned, noted or widely known."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "18482fa5-1786-426a-aefb-7e1e3be29d60",
                                "sense_id": "bc154adc-0bfd-3fbb-9a8a-f29d4b0a5684",
                                "text": "Edward Churchill still attended to his work in a hopeless mechanical manner like a sleep-walker who walks safely on a well-known round. But his Roman collar galled him, his cossack stifled him, his biretta was as uncomfortable as a merry-andrew's cap and bells."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e49bfc99-d52e-45a1-99da-a48f22fe8623",
                                "sense_id": "bc154adc-0bfd-3fbb-9a8a-f29d4b0a5684",
                                "text": "Furthermore, this increase in risk is comparable to the risk of death from leukemia after long-term exposure to benzene, another solvent, which has the well-known property of causing this type of cancer."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9eb80ebf-112b-48de-befe-3abb82b48f90",
                                "sense_id": "bc154adc-0bfd-3fbb-9a8a-f29d4b0a5684",
                                "text": "At 6 weeks and 9 months, the babies’ motor skills were tested using the Peabody Developmental Motor Scales, a well-known assessment tool that looks at gross, fine and total motor abilities."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "594f6eca-bf8d-4b5b-b132-7ce01a96dea2",
                                "sense_id": "bc154adc-0bfd-3fbb-9a8a-f29d4b0a5684",
                                "text": "Less well-known is NR's High Marnham test track, which occupies part of the former Lancashire, Derbyshire and East Coast Railway (LDECR) Chesterfield-Lincoln line in Nottinghamshire."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "62ad2e74-7fcb-34e1-9415-45b43bc5ee35",
                        "entry_id": "ee988cf0-3c8b-371d-9a5c-4a4869768335",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Generally recognized; reserved for some usual purpose."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7ecfd45a-74a6-473b-a2f5-9537560fe63b",
                                "sense_id": "62ad2e74-7fcb-34e1-9415-45b43bc5ee35",
                                "text": "We would like to catalog other sockets which are supposed to be well-known"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b820ce73-d918-459e-bea4-703aa806c6a5",
                                "sense_id": "62ad2e74-7fcb-34e1-9415-45b43bc5ee35",
                                "text": "If the call to this function fails, you can assume the SID was invalid — even if it's a well-known SID."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "954b87f0-4c0c-4edd-be62-9143e65ac042",
                                "sense_id": "62ad2e74-7fcb-34e1-9415-45b43bc5ee35",
                                "text": "A common approach is for the server to accept messages at a well-known port."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
